  "name": "Example: Identifying Whether the Trapezoidal Rule Sum Gives an Underestimate or Overestimate",
  "problem": "For which of the graphs shown below would the trapezoidal sum give an underestimate of the area under the curve between $x=-2$ and $x=2?$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14055663/assets/97f48d1d5c9f54e5351a6f3453fe948959d26a36d30d74f9425bf40e4fd54413.png)",
